{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "48a3d1517de6ba1896d9d0d498a52053ff3e3d96e6a862ad44b0f492f555b369", "ja": "応援は大丈夫ですから、麗花も掃除なさい？\n人手は、いくらあっても構いませんもの。", "zh": "不用加油打气了，丽花你也来大扫除吧？\n毕竟人手这种东西，再多都不嫌多嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "4555bbfeee88c1a74a27a7e1b83f52ef3899824e30f1821c2caa1b5a13f3f65a", "ja": "はーい♪\nけど、大掃除って、何をしたらいいのかな？", "zh": "好呀♪\n不过，大扫除要做些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "9f877d9d17a1e11015ee85b6d6b967702491bfd5b5580400f92e66901aa21029", "ja": "あの、千鶴さん。麗花さんって確か、\nお掃除が苦手だって聞いたような……。", "zh": "那个，千鹤小姐。我记得好像听说过，丽花小姐不擅长打扫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "2ea1982580b6a2953fe55755bd20c31a190fea1c5508ebaad970b8f12a3523d0", "ja": "そういえば……風花達から、以前、\n聞いたことがありますわね……。", "zh": "说起来……我以前好像听风花她们提起过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "ec7b66cf8ed4437eb681e50cbf1274abc3ebb1be1383f0aa6293b2f0ebd7b47d", "ja": "……麗花！　わたくしと一緒に参りましょう。\nまずは、床に落ちているゴミを拾いますわよ！", "zh": "……丽花！请和我一起行动吧。\n首先，我们来捡起掉在地上的垃圾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "35360f5574461564866fc4e747558d9d1fcd6aa5459e96aa1f0eb8be8a15da69", "ja": "ゴミ拾いなら、まかせてください♪　登山道のゴミ、\n見かけたらいつも拾ってますから！　えっへん♪", "zh": "捡垃圾的话，就交给我吧♪登山道上的垃圾，\n我每次看到都会捡起来！哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "9dffdd1342dce0ef9d1b868b35797ff35912d48be1fd0f6d44aecddac01ce154", "ja": "なるほど……！\n千鶴さんの采配、麗花さんにぴったりかも！", "zh": "原来如此……！\n千鹤小姐的安排，说不定很适合丽花小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1007_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a9334fa34ef7778956c86601e81b394312da9f315c46c43de2ade6e0219318db", "ja": "お待たせ！　物置きにあった掃除道具、\n色々持ってきたぞ。好きなのを使ってくれ。", "zh": "让你久等了！我把储物间里的清洁工具拿来了不少。挑喜欢的用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "c4e5c19d6fcc3d48c2a5d2c1280f751a62deaa3e39ff5a47bcdb06333d9181e4", "ja": "人数が揃ってくれて助かったよ。流石に、\nウチらだけでやるには、劇場は広いからな……。", "zh": "能凑齐这么多人真是帮大忙了。毕竟只靠我们几个，剧场实在太大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4d7cfca0c8d180ac91f7c5ebcd565fab13c2b778622ab7833fffe06c8c52af28", "ja": "みんなでやれば、秒で終わるっしょ♪\nアタシ達の劇場だし、ピカピカにしなきゃね！", "zh": "大家一起上的话，几秒钟就能搞定啦♪\n毕竟是属于我们的剧场，一定要打扫得亮闪闪才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1012_p", "source_sha256": "81178245e626cda612b9f086643a3c6d803cffb7d170cc2086ce7eb86768f689", "ja": "うーん。普段あまり使ってないせいか、\n資料室のホコリがすごいな……。", "zh": "嗯——可能是因为平时不怎么用，资料室里的灰尘真多啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9e2c222950b3ee18b0874831f4d517ab284092485aedc027cf0f469b9c06a8b", "ja": "そうですわね……棚の上は、はたきをかけましょうか。\nまず、ホコリやゴミを床に落とさないとですわ。", "zh": "是啊……架子上面，先用掸子扫一扫吧。\n得先把灰尘和垃圾弄到地上才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1014_p", "source_sha256": "caf2dd4e6deedee81ff7ffebb23eb6a967481a80d95949e725416c6a537fdf85", "ja": "なら、それは俺がやります。\n千鶴さんは、少し離れててください。みんなも。", "zh": "那这件事就交给我吧。\n千鹤小姐，请稍微离远一点。大家也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1015_se", "source_sha256": "9241666e8662d0a17bf519b3104811c03ea7443b8d0cc74ef4671ecc68ccfadd", "ja": "パタパタパタパタ……\nドサッ", "zh": "扑棱扑棱扑棱扑棱……\n扑通", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "447358f8d5dbb1ab4027bfd110b60f5d24541f494b94a9c59a05dd41a3192ea5", "ja": "ん？\n{$P$}、なんか落ちたよ？", "zh": "嗯？\n{$P$}，好像有什么东西掉下来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "c0779393a4e141698fc62b79ec3953ad6edaa71e944feb92c86a093bb23dfb68", "ja": "棚の上にあったみたいだな。\nえっと……写真だな。アルバムか？", "zh": "好像是在架子上啊。\n呃……是照片吧。相册吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "49904720e091777e4d5cf34ef4dfe6790da1cb7d1b130ef488df54071da52cef", "ja": "私たちが写ってる……\nあっ、お仕事をしてる時の写真だね！", "zh": "这里面有我们……\n啊，是工作时拍的照片呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1019_p", "source_sha256": "22795b04e2cf9b5702ccd3f709471c20f9ce4d64519dc2e4a8745607d38e510b", "ja": "ああ、うん。みんなのこの一年の仕事を、\nアルバムにまとめようと思って……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。我想着把大家这一年的工作，整理成相册……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cd624fce094151dca79695280f265423c2394bb9415fb97bc8726bbae92c77cc", "ja": "仕事の合間に整理して、途中になってたんだった。", "zh": "原来是在工作间隙整理，结果整理到一半就停下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "62b9a34697a1a0b41ae01c28adcf8e8951185c22f545389e3b924cc20c7c16f0", "ja": "これは……秋葉原でコラボやった時の？\nうわ、なんかもう懐かしいんだけど！？", "zh": "这是……在秋叶原联动时的？\n哇，感觉已经变得好怀念了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "98a652856a23a93315aae57c4cf94171edc778c5a937efbf648b922c1b073209", "ja": "これは、ヤッコが観光大使を務めた時のだな……。\nはは、立派じゃないか。", "zh": "这是ヤッコ担任观光大使时的照片啊……  \n哈哈，挺像样的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "079ae18649620ac9f3ae579b33009e764ef06bf438dc835ce5b0b0e6d0d8863c", "ja": "こっちは、ひなたちゃんの観光大使の写真だね！\nりんごみたいな笑顔で、とってもカワイイ♪", "zh": "这边是小日向担任旅游大使时的照片呢！\n笑容像苹果一样，特别可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1024_p", "source_sha256": "87571596b5294d4f74b212a3248a3c4447040eb5fe00b3b90625bb2fc4da69b7", "ja": "こうして改めて見ると、近頃は企業コラボや\n地方での仕事が増えたな。みんなのお陰だ。", "zh": "这样重新一看，最近企业合作和地方的工作确实增加了不少。多亏了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "d2a17b1e43c17dff0bdde549d3e289698fd8cbea1d5764c97b5a72080cdfb6b1", "ja": "地方といえば、名古屋にも伺いましたわね。\nいろんなお店や施設の紹介をさせていただいて……。", "zh": "说到地方，我们也去过名古屋呢。\n介绍了形形色色的店铺与设施……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "1ec40fd67e7337dbdf9ad82df0dc8bb37bdf8643b3d77edf658b2f7800a8ec9b", "ja": "土地の名物や、お店にちなんだコラボメニューも\nたっくさんでしたね！　個人的にも勉強になったな～。", "zh": "当地的特产，还有和店铺相关的联动餐品\n也是超级多呢！我个人也学到了不少呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "3fc3adc5efcb998df61a36abaf90692f40e54720f2420d8cecd306fee91da196", "ja": "そういえば、ウチらのグッズだけじゃなくて、売店の\nうどんが売り切れたって聞いた時は驚いたな……。", "zh": "说起来，我听说不只是我们的周边，连小卖部的乌冬面都卖光了，当时还真是吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "26fad68325fb97b3f6b24e534dec319f3b2c6457bdc9342f2a6edc0312ea56fc", "ja": "あ、それ！　静香がうどん好きだからなんでしょ？\nなんかそういうのって、面白いよね。", "zh": "啊，对了！是因为静香喜欢乌冬面吧？\n这种事还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1029_p", "source_sha256": "350f9adf963f0a129c95332f61d9d4eb0783bbdd3cff3781bb734e0db3b9a026", "ja": "そうだな。相乗効果というか……\n何にせよ、本当にありがたい事だよ。", "zh": "是啊，可以说是相互促进吧……\n不管怎么说，真的非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1030_null", "source_sha256": "3abd832e852055e44bcb61a74c160b0d93cdd92e502fcd711ceb03b2e4f7c77a", "ja": "プルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1031_p", "source_sha256": "601939c754bf1a755b59863c44f5e52b04e5deaa15eb5e92f9ec237bbd2bec47", "ja": "ん、電話だ……。\n社長？", "zh": "嗯，来电话了……\n社长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1032_president", "source_sha256": "c0b446a163c9a32cdfc9ec6fa2046f0d9143835636f57cd7cc68994c57b8cb23", "ja": "やあ、君！　年の瀬にすまんね。\n大掃除の調子はどうかね？", "zh": "哎呀，你来啦！到年底了还麻烦你真不好意思。\n大扫除进展得如何呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1033_p", "source_sha256": "9b5849995c735d5285e90e21f24bd534dca6a8b107b94b1b7a99dd63f5ecacfe", "ja": "お疲れ様です、社長！　大掃除、順調です。\nアイドルのみんなも、手伝ってくれてますし。", "zh": "辛苦了，社长！大扫除进行得很顺利。偶像们也都来帮忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1034_president", "source_sha256": "8f88332bcd8ac19b43aa174d5fe8ce72489a0739a07a57df029e14ab403da3ba", "ja": "結構結構！　実は電話をしたのは、\n君にいち早く耳に入れたい案件があってね……。", "zh": "很好很好！其实我打电话是因为有件事想尽早告诉你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1035_president", "source_sha256": "00a30757896961adfff6aa8da13ea96230822dfa5ddb11aa205fccdfdd91d03e", "ja": "とある地方の自治体から、\n765プロにコラボのオファーが届いたんだ！", "zh": "某地方的自治体向765事务所发来了联动邀请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_160_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_160_1036_p", "source_sha256": "835648128b98866bd1580a98dad2739b7dc06bf34dba3020d328ff0db613ddfd", "ja": "コラボ……？", "zh": "联动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
